The '''history of the camera''' began even before the introduction of [[photography]]. [[Camera]]s evolved from the ''[[camera obscura]]'' through many generations of photographic technology{{snd}}[[daguerreotype]]s, [[calotype]]s, [[dry plate]]s, [[photographic film|film]]{{snd}}to the modern day with [[digital camera]]s and [[camera phone]]s.

